# FLINTHOLD: ten stages and three villages, all sound (the drawn path is
# the routes, every route runs from an edge to the cave, every stage's last
# wave brings a boss); the art is the right size; the last stage has 20
# waves from three spawn points and its last wave brings all Four Lords.
game flinthold
